{"id":"meister","lemma":"Meister","pos":"noun","rank":619,"glosses":["master","champion"],"ipa":"/ˈmaɪ̯stɐ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5e/De-Meister.ogg/De-Meister.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Meisters","plural":"Meister","feminine":"Meisterin"},"examples":[{"text":"Er hat seinen Meister gefunden.","en":"He found his master.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"found, located"}]},{"text":"Übung macht den Meister.","en":"Practice makes perfect.","words":[{"g":"practice"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist ein Meister der Verkleidung.","en":"Tom is a master of disguise.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"disguise, costumes"}]},{"text":"Hacker sind Meister darin, Computersicherheitsmechanismen zu umgehen.","en":"Hackers are adept at getting around computer security measures.","words":[{"g":"hacker"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"in it"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to handle"}]},{"text":"Der Meister ist schon öfter gescheitert, als es der Anfänger überhaupt versucht hat.","en":"The master has failed more times than the beginner has even tried.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"already"},{"g":"ofttimes"},{"g":"to fail","l":"scheitern"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"to begin","l":"anfangen"},{"g":"overall, in general"},{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"versuchen"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]}]}